{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50143","headline":"灭胡 · 王无竞","name":"灭胡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉军屡北丧，胡马遂南駈。\n羽书夜惊急，边柝乱传呼。\n鬬军却不进，关城势已孤。\n黄云塞沙落，（项云「落」当作「路」。\n蒋云「落」爲「聚落」、「村落」之「落」。\n）白刃断交衢。\n朔雾围未解，凿山泉尚枯。\n伏波塞後援，都尉失前途。\n亭障多堕毁，金镞无金（全）[一]躯。\n独有山东客，上书图灭胡。\n（[一]俞云：「第二『金』是『全』之误。\n」）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王无竞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50143.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50143","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}